        <body>
            <div xml:id="d567">

                <pb facs="0645" n="387" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg387"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2196</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 10, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ambassador from Germany called about 11.40 and “expressed his deep regret
                    that the events of the war had led to the loss of the so many American
                    lives.”</p>
                <p>Words in quotation marks in Ambassador’s writing.</p>
            </div>
